<title>USA: Morgan Stanley completes Van Kampen purchase.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley completes Van Kampen purchase.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Group Inc said on Thursday that it completed the acquisition of Van Kampen American Capital Inc.</p>
<p>The company said on June 24 that it signed a definitive agreement to buy Van Kampen, the country's fourth largest non-proprietary mutual fund provider, for $745 million.</p>
<p>After completing the Van Kampen acquisition,  Morgan Stanley said it has assets under management of over $165 billion.</p>
</text>
